WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.616 --> 00:00:17.245
It the last day of cooking class, and Izzie felt nervous.

2
00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.847
Guests were coming for a special meal after class.

3
00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.609
She wanted to make Chef proud of them.

4
00:00:25.629 --> 00:00:29.531
"Remember, Chef, don't help us!"

5
00:00:30.032 --> 00:00:30.632
Izzie said.

6
00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:34.146
"We picked the appetizer recipe ourselves.

7
00:00:35.307 --> 00:00:36.929
We can make it ourselves too!"

8
00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.352
Chef leaned against the counter.

9
00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:42.433
"I won't do a thing.

10
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:43.955
I promise."

11
00:00:45.616 --> 00:00:47.298
"Good," Bobby said.

12
00:00:47.318 --> 00:00:51.701
"Let's get started on the party pinwheels," Nina said.

13
00:00:51.721 --> 00:00:55.565
"The cream cheese is soft!"

14
00:00:57.346 --> 00:00:59.208
Izzie put the cream cheese into a bowl.

15
00:01:00.724 --> 00:01:02.426
Jason added chopped green onions.

16
00:01:04.187 --> 00:01:06.029
Bobby stirred the ingredients together.

17
00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.873
They each spread a tortilla with a thin layer of cream cheese.

18
00:01:10.893 --> 00:01:15.597
"Be sure to spread it to the edges," Jason said.

19
00:01:17.258 --> 00:01:18.900
Next they chose fillings.

20
00:01:20.881 --> 00:01:24.785
Izzie covered her tortilla with chopped tomato, bell pepper, and cucumber.

21
00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.208
Bobby chose ham and cheese.

22
00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:31.309
"My pinwheels will be delicious!"

23
00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:36.232
Jason sprinkled diced red onion on his tortilla.

24
00:01:37.212 --> 00:01:38.973
He added chicken and avocado.

25
00:01:41.154 --> 00:01:45.277
Nina put sliced mushroom, tomato, and mozzarella cheese on her tortilla.

26
00:01:45.297 --> 00:01:50.359
"Chef will like mine best," Izzie thought.

27
00:01:50.379 --> 00:01:54.121
"I used only vegetables from his garden."

28
00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:58.784
The kids rolled their tortillas up to form tubes.

29
00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.549
They wrapped them in plastic wrap.

30
00:02:01.569 --> 00:02:04.911
"Now we have to chill them.

31
00:02:06.012 --> 00:02:08.573
Then they'll be easy to slice," Izzie said.

32
00:02:08.593 --> 00:02:11.555
"They have to look like pinwheels!"

33
00:02:16.037 --> 00:02:17.918
They put their rolls in the refrigerator.

34
00:02:19.619 --> 00:02:22.381
Izzie looked at Chef, who was quietly reading recipes.

35
00:02:22.401 --> 00:02:24.462
"Good job, Chef."

36
00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:26.583
He gave her a thumbs-up.

37
00:02:27.684 --> 00:02:28.144
"You too."

38
00:02:30.464 --> 00:02:32.586
The kids set out everything they had prepared.

39
00:02:33.427 --> 00:02:35.689
They had worked hard during the last two classes.

40
00:02:37.431 --> 00:02:40.514
There were salmon cakes, cheesy spinach balls, and bread.

41
00:02:41.474 --> 00:02:43.476
For dessert, they made peach cookies.

42
00:02:45.378 --> 00:02:46.139
Izzie sighed.

43
00:02:46.159 --> 00:02:50.323
"The table looks perfect!"

44
00:02:51.544 --> 00:02:54.326
"Let's finish our pinwheels," Nina said.

45
00:02:57.368 --> 00:03:00.591
They took the tortilla rolls from the refrigerator and unwrapped them.

46
00:03:01.732 --> 00:03:04.274
They each sliced their tortilla to create pinwheels.

47
00:03:04.294 --> 00:03:07.537
"They look awesome!"

48
00:03:09.339 --> 00:03:10.920
Izzie placed them on two trays.

49
00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.945
Just then Cinnamon burst into the room.

50
00:03:17.306 --> 00:03:19.849
The dog jumped up, putting her paws on the table.

51
00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.252
A tray of pinwheels crashed to the floor!

52
00:03:24.464 --> 00:03:27.986
Cinnamon gobbled up several pinwheels before Bobby led her away.

53
00:03:29.748 --> 00:03:30.588
Nina sighed.

54
00:03:30.608 --> 00:03:33.530
"At least one tray is left."

55
00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:36.652
"What a disaster."

56
00:03:36.672 --> 00:03:40.475
Izzie looked down, waiting for Chef to snap at them.

57
00:03:40.495 --> 00:03:44.477
"I'll help you clean up," he said calmly.

58
00:03:44.497 --> 00:03:46.118
"If I'm allowed."

59
00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:52.223
"You must be glad this is our last class," Izzie mumbled.

60
00:03:52.243 --> 00:03:56.317
"What?" Chef shook his head.

61
00:03:56.337 --> 00:03:58.458
"I'm so proud of you!

62
00:03:59.519 --> 00:04:04.122
You've learned so much—including that cooking sometimes involves mistakes.

63
00:04:05.243 --> 00:04:06.804
But there's always a solution."

64
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:10.006
Izzie smiled.

65
00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:12.248
"I'll remember that!"

66
00:04:14.049 --> 00:04:15.490
Soon everything was ready.

67
00:04:17.011 --> 00:04:18.152
The first guest arrived.

68
00:04:18.172 --> 00:04:23.516
"Ethan!" the junior chefs shouted happily.

69
00:04:25.072 --> 00:04:27.193
Ethan grinned at them and pointed to the table.

70
00:04:27.213 --> 00:04:29.873
"Wow, you made all this?"

71
00:04:29.893 --> 00:04:33.414
"Try a pinwheel," Nina said.

72
00:04:35.055 --> 00:04:36.015
They each took one.

73
00:04:36.035 --> 00:04:42.377
"I'll miss cooking class," Izzie said with a sigh.

74
00:04:42.397 --> 00:04:47.298
"I'm teaching another kids' class during winter break," Chef said.

75
00:04:47.318 --> 00:04:51.659
"Hooray! I'll sign up," Izzie said.

76
00:04:51.679 --> 00:04:53.480
"Can I sign up too?"

77
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.720
Ethan asked.

78
00:04:55.745 --> 00:04:56.225
"Of course."

79
00:04:57.207 --> 00:04:57.928
Chef nodded.

80
00:04:57.948 --> 00:05:01.434
"I've learned something too from this class.

81
00:05:02.396 --> 00:05:04.219
Junior chefs are the best!"
